WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
An anxious server clutches a tray with a sandwich and drink.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.400
The tray tilts while she tries to keep smiling for the customer.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.750
She slips, twists and catches the meal without dropping it.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.650
Plates arc safely into place, delivering lunch to the squad.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.350
She presents the perfect tray and waits for a tip.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.700
The receipt says zero. The exhausted server gives one last forced smile.
